	)
	(text "Drain toward VSYS, source toward VMOT: body diodes conduct VMOT to VSYS, so regen still reaches the pack with the banks open (PLAN 3.4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fe6241c2-7b30-5d4b-9d78-7865755fdfcd")
	)
	(text "VMOT precharge (IPT015N10N5 SOA is 0.7 A at 54 V, 10 ms, so a hard close on 1.8 mF is out). U302 EN and INP2 on ESTOP_EN_B: loop closed and latch armed, G2 precharges at once, bank B stays open.\nBANK_B_CLOSE (INP1, 100k down) closes bank B on command once VMOT is within 0.5 V of VSYS. Close at 0.5 V or less so U301 does not trip: 0.84 s, 1.01 s at +20% C, firmware timeout 1.2 s, then open the loop. EN low kills G1 and G2. Energy 2.68 J, tau 180 ms, peak 29.8 W."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f49b7fb-75fc-57f0-a1b5-75ded3688c45")
	)
