	(text "Status (TPS48100 has no VDS output): MID, VMOT dividers 1M / 56k, 3.3 V = 62 V, plus VSYS on LP. Bank A short reads MID near VSYS with both open and VMOT low.\n\nBank A short protection: ISCP 10.5k = 40 mV (31.6-49.5 mV) on RS201 0.3 mOhm = 105-165 A, under BMS SCD and over OCD1 max 93 A. About 10 us, latch-off (100k + 680 pF across TMR), FLT_A to the supervisor. Clears on an E-stop cycle. Keeps compute up on a VMOT short."
